# FireCraft panel snapshot — the CS6 panel inventory as the shell draws it.
#
# Generated by `cargo run -p xtask -- panel-snapshot --bless`; do not
# edit by hand. A panel added, renamed, reordered, re-docked, or
# stripped of a header affordance without a deliberate re-pin fails
# the build.
#
# id	side	order	header	visible	toggleable	affordances
